        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            UREVO is a sound mid-market buy and the best-seller badge is not the reason.
            <strong class="text-white">Sales rank measures price and prominence as much as
            quality</strong>, and the review corpus describes the first month far better than the
            fourth year.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Check the minimum speed, the continuous motor rating and the running surface on the
            specific listing, use the returns window properly, and
            <a href="/how-often-to-lubricate-treadmill/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">lubricate from month one</a>
            — on a machine whose
            <a href="/treadmill-repair/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">controller board cannot be replaced</a>,
            that routine is the warranty.
          </p>
